Package: bmfvs
Title: Bayesian Model-Free Variable Screening
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Eduardo", "Vasquez", , "eduardo.vasqueztapia@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bayesian model-free variable screening for multivariate responses
    of mixed type (continuous, categorical, and count-valued). The response
    distribution is modeled nonparametrically with a finite mixture using a
    product kernel, and predictors are screened via posterior probabilities of
    conditional independence computed from closed-form Bayes factors, with
    empirical Bayes estimation of the prior probabilities.
